{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "beatguider",
  "compatibility_date": "2025-01-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./out",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  },
  "observability": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "//": "BeatGuider BG-1 — Cloudflare Workers Static Assets config (spec §3, §22). Fully static-exportable. No request-time Node.js runtime. Newsletter/contact forms use client-side requests to a third-party service or a dedicated Worker — never a reason to convert the site to SSR. Do not add OpenNext or SSR unless dynamic server features are genuinely required later. Canonical hostname: beatguider.com (www → apex permanent redirect handled at the DNS/Worker level)."
}
